  "question": {
    "text": "If<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>l</mi></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mn>11</mn></mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> are co-prime then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
